*~
*.fasl
*.*x64fsl
# Emacs autosave (#foo#) and lock (.#foo) files.  This was `#*#', which
# git read as a COMMENT because of the leading #.  `**/' is the house
# form -- no leading-# problem, and it matches at any depth.
# Audit 2026-08-16.
**/#*#
.#*

# `tailwind/node_modules' used to be here.  There is no tailwind/ in this
# demo any more: it held a package-lock.json and nothing else -- no
# package.json, no config, no css -- while the actual stylesheet came,
# and still comes, from the shared build in /projects/apps/tailwind
# (demos-input.css scans ../../demos/**).  Deleted 2026-08-16.
